    "ISVforce Guide v66.0 \u2014 https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.packagingGuide.meta/packagingGuide/packaging_intro.htm",
    "Uninstall a Package and Delete Components \u2014 https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.pkg1_dev.meta/pkg1_dev/uninstall_package.htm",
